                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Nice vibe, good food, kid friendly with a good kids meal. Came for a late weekend lunch and we were seated quickly. It feels like it was opened by a group of friends than being very commercial, but the scale is impressive. Mexican burger is small but tasty and spicy. The fries has a unique treatment, so it\u0027s definitely memorable. No on-site parking that I\u0027m aware of. The closest parking lots are all 500m+ away.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
